":"add","path":"/metadata/risk","value":"critical"},{"op":"add","path":"/metadata/confidence","value":"high"},{"op":"add","path":"/metadata/severity","value":"high"},{"op":"add","path":"/metadata/environment","value":"pm-cli 2026.9.3; Node 26.5.0; Linux; fresh merge-driver install"},{"op":"add","path":"/metadata/repro_steps","value":"Create divergent scalar values, merge to produce a field decision, then inspect the receipt and pm merge report; confirm base/ours/theirs are null and no command returns the discarded value."},{"op":"add","path":"/metadata/expected_result","value":"A bounded privacy policy makes discarded values reviewable through a supported command or records a truthful retrievable reference, while hashes remain available for verification and oversized or sensitive values fail closed."},{"op":"add","path":"/metadata/actual_result","value":"The only durable evidence is a digest; the agent cannot discover the discarded scalar from pm merge report and must locate historical branch state manually."},{"op":"add","path":"/metadata/component","value":"sdk/merge-receipts"},{"op":"add","path":"/metadata/dependencies","value":[{"id":"pm-rh98vo","kind":"related","created_at":"2026-09-03T18:06:37.336Z","author":"harness:codex","source_kind":"cli:create:dep","author_source":"detected"},{"id":"pm-z1z96w","kind":"recurs_from","created_at":"2026-09-03T18:06:37.336Z","author":"harness:codex","source_kind":"cli:create:dep","author_source":"detected"}]},{"op":"add","path":"/metadata/comments","value":[{"created_at":"2026-09-03T18:06:37.336Z","author":"harness:codex","text":"GitHub source: https://github.com/unbraind/pm-cli/issues/1185. All-status duplicate check searched discarded value, hash-only, merge report, and value availability. pm-z1z96w shipped truthful proof-backed reconciliation for hash-only receipts and pm-rh98vo shipped durable receipt discovery, but their live resolutions do not provide a readable discarded value. This report is a recurrence/boundary exte